!!! oculus/compositor/compositor.mat
!!! The main composition engine.
!!!
!!! The compositor takes the semantic scene and produces
!!! rendered frames. It handles z-order sorting, clipping,
!!! damage tracking, and output routing.

book oculus.compositor.compositor

read everything from oculus.compositor.surface
read everything from oculus.compositor.frame
read everything from oculus.compositor.damage
read everything from oculus.compositor.clipping
read everything from oculus.compositor.output
read everything from oculus.scene.z-order
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.viewport
read everything from oculus.window.record
read everything from oculus.scene.manager
read everything from oculus.scene.builder
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! The compositor state — tracks frame revision and dirty state.

public compositor-state begin record
    field frame-revision as override long
    field is-dirty as boolean
end record
